but physical setup stopped before benchmark milestones:

  ERROR: EC_HEAD_SAMPLE: training slice requires 200 rows, found 0

Input shape:

  data/staged-current/ec_real_10k_queries.tsv   200 rows
  data/staged-current/ec_real_50k_queries.tsv  1000 rows
  data/staged-current/ec_real_100k_queries.tsv 1000 rows

The training-landmark path reserves a disjoint 200-row training slice after
the query rows.  The native 10k fixture therefore cannot exercise this path;
the failure is an input-fixture contract failure, not selector evidence.
No recall, latency, storage, or isolated-attribution result was produced.
The failed 10k cluster and raw run directory were removed after capture.
